      "writtenOn": "2017-12-08T09:17:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This will fail if we get command complete before connection complete.\n\nThe Core Specification does not state an order of these events as far as I can tell. Therefore the rule is that the events may arrive in any order. The test needs to support this.",
